          "settings": {
            "heading": "Water replaces fluid. Not salt.",
            "text": "<p>Plain water puts fluid back, but not the sodium you've sweated out. That's why sports nutrition guidelines suggest including sodium in drinks during long sessions, in hot conditions, or when you sweat heavily.</p><p>For short, easy sessions, water is usually enough. Electrolife is for the sessions where you finish soaked.</p>",
